flowchart TD
  Start[WorkflowRecoveryService 定时扫描] --> Lease{任务租约过期?}
  Lease -->|否| Pending[等待 next_run_at]
  Lease -->|是| Fence[递增 fencing_token 并回收租约]
  Fence --> Write{已有 operation_execution?}
  Write -->|否| Resume[WorkflowEngine 恢复轮次检查点与上下文]
  Resume --> Cached{已有工具结果?}
  Cached -->|是| Reuse[复用 callId 与结果]
  Cached -->|否| Read[ToolDispatcher 受控只读查询]
  Write -->|是| Lookup[ToolExecutionService 按原幂等键核对]
  Lookup --> Result{外部明确结果?}
  Result -->|成功| Apply[本地幂等记账与独立通知审批]
  Result -->|明确失败| Manual[MANUAL_REVIEW]
  Result -->|未知或查不到| Manual
  Pending --> Approval{等待审批超时?}
  Approval -->|是| Expire[旧审批失效并转人工]
